    "title_en": "Cartan geometry and the Hamiltonian analysis of gravitational actions in terms of forms",
    "abstract_en": "The purpose of the paper is to review the Hamiltonian formulation for several actions related to general relativity that can be written in terms of differential forms. As we will show the powerful ideas of Cartan geometry can be used to simplify the Hamiltonian analysis and arrive at a coherent and comprehensive geometrical understanding of it.",
